I think this is meant to refer to lit potions of oil, and was a rather
different problem; it was possible that a potion found in bones might
go out before it should, or last much longer than it ought to, because
it was still operating on the old game's clock rather than the new
one. Getting it set correctly on entering the new game (as lamps and
candles are) was what was fixed.

